# REST

## 1. Admin Section

### 1.1 Login
POST http://localhost:9093/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "",
  "password": "",
  "rememberMe": true
}

### 1.2 Signup
//400 Bad Request Only 1 Super Admin 
POST http://localhost:9093/admin/register-admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "",
  "firstname": "",
  "lastname": "",
  "password": ""
}

### 1.3 Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:9093/admin/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": ""
}

### 1.3.1 Reset Password
POST http://localhost:9093/admin/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resetPasswordToken": "",
  "password": ""
}

### 1.4 Profile
GET http://localhost:9093/admin/users/me 
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 


## 2. User Section

### 2.1 Login
POST http://localhost:9093/api/auth/local
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "",
  "password": "",
  "rememberMe": true
}

### 2.2 Signup
POST http://localhost:9093/api/auth/local/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "",
  "email": "",
  "password": ""
}

### 2.3 Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:9093/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": ""
}

### 2.3.1 Reset Password
POST http://localhost:9093/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "",
  "password": "",
  "passwordConfirmation": ""
}

### 2.4 Profile
GET http://localhost:9093/api/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer


## 3. Content Section

### 3.1 Student

### 3.1.1 Create
POST http://localhost:9093/api/students
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 

{
  "data": {
    "name": "",
    "mobile": "",
    "cardId": ""
  }
}

### 3.1.2 List All
GET http://localhost:9093/api/students
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 

### 3.1.3 List with ID
GET http://localhost:9093/api/students/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 

### 3.1.4 Update
PUT http://localhost:9093/api/students/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 

{
  "data": {
    "name": ""
  }
}

